"width":14,"height":15},{"text":"노드가","x":391,"y":1653,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크에","x":506,"y":1653,"width":164,"height":39},{"text":"참가할","x":686,"y":1654,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"때","x":800,"y":1654,"width":30,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크의","x":847,"y":1654,"width":167,"height":39},{"text":"중앙","x":1030,"y":1655,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"검색","x":1115,"y":1654,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"서비스에","x":1196,"y":1654,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"자신이","x":1348,"y":1654,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"제공하는","x":1470,"y":1656,"width":143,"height":38},{"text":"서비","x":1626,"y":1656,"width":62,"height":39}]},{"text":"스를 등록한다. 특정 서비스를 원하는 노드는 먼저 이 중앙 검색 서비스를 통하여 어","words":[{"text":"스를","x":390,"y":1719,"width":70,"height":35},{"text":"등록한다.","x":470,"y":1718,"width":143,"height":38},{"text":"특정","x":627,"y":1718,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"서비스를","x":708,"y":1719,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"원하는","x":857,"y":1719,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"노드는","x":971,"y":1721,"width":105,"height":34},{"text":"먼저","x":1090,"y":1718,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":1172,"y":1719,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"중앙","x":1217,"y":1718,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"검색","x":1302,"y":1718,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"서비스를","x":1384,"y":1719,"width":144,"height":38},{"text":"통하여","x":1540,"y":1720,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"어","x":1661,"y":1721,"width":27,"height":39}]},{"text":"떤 노드가 서비스를 제공하는지를 확인하여야 한다. 나머지 통신은 클라이 언트와 서","words":[{"text":"떤","x":392,"y":1781,"width":31,"height":37},{"text":"노드가","x":436,"y":1783,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"서비스를","x":552,"y":1783,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"제공하는지를","x":699,"y":1783,"width":204,"height":39},{"text":"확인하여야","x":914,"y":1783,"width":175,"height":39},{"text":"한다.","x":1101,"y":1783,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"나머지","x":1194,"y":1782,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"통신은","x":1311,"y":1783,"width":108,"height":37},{"text":"클라이","x":1431,"y":1783,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"언트와","x":1543,"y":1784,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"서","x":1660,"y":1785,"width":28,"height":39}]},{"text":"비스 제공자 사이에서만 발생하게 된다.","words":[{"text":"비스","x":392,"y":1847,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"제공자","x":471,"y":1848,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"사이에서만","x":583,"y":1848,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"발생하게","x":764,"y":1848,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"된다.","x":913,"y":1848,"width":75,"height":38}]},{"text":"• 위의 대안 기법은 중앙 검색 서비스를 시용하지 않는다. 클라이언트로 동작하는 피","words":[{"text":"•","x":346,"y":1933,"width":15,"height":15},{"text":"위의","x":389,"y":1923,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"대안","x":473,"y":1923,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"기법은","x":556,"y":1924,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"중앙","x":670,"y":1924,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"검색","x":754,"y":1924,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"서비스를","x":835,"y":1924,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"시용하지","x":986,"y":1923,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"않는다.","x":1142,"y":1922,"width":110,"height":39},{"text":"클라이언트로","x":1270,"y":1922,"width":213,"height":39},{"text":"동작하는","x":1498,"y":1923,"width":146,"height":39},{"text":"피","x":1659,"y":1925,"width":28,"height":39}]},{"text":"어는 원하는 서비스를 제공하는 노드를 찾아내기 위하여 네트워크상의 모든 노드에","words":[{"text":"어는","x":388,"y":1988,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"원하는","x":470,"y":1989,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"서비스를","x":586,"y":1989,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"제공하는","x":735,"y":1989,"width":136,"height":40},{"text":"노드를","x":883,"y":1991,"width":104,"height":36},{"text":"찾아내기","x":1001,"y":1988,"width":133,"height":40},{"text":"위하여","x":1154,"y":1987,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"네트워크상의","x":1273,"y":1987,"width":208,"height":40},{"text":"모든","x":1499,"y":1990,"width":73,"height":36},{"text":"노드에","x":1586,"y":1991,"width":102,"height":39}]},{"text":"게 서비스 요청 메시지를 방송한다. 그 서비스를 제공하는 노드 또는 노드들은 피어","words":[{"text":"게","x":386,"y":2054,"width":30,"height":39},{"text":"서비스","x":434,"y":2054,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"요